#: ../../modules/link.md:72 0fd56c5154ce43cf848b2aa989bfddce
msgid "Replace the entity at its relative position and local rotation. This operation repeated in a loop simulates the movements and rotations of the parent entity."
msgstr "将实体放置在关联的位置和局部旋转处。在循环中重复此操作可模拟父实体的移动和旋转。"

