#: ../../modules/link.md cbebe1096c0443afa9741f506861bcdb
#: dcbdfa0822ec484fa039baeafb5ff7d0
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../modules/link.md:100 88f902ad5ee4482aa389922d2b779d54
msgid "Replace the entity at its relative position. This operation repeated in a loop simulates the movements of the parent entity."
msgstr "将实体放置在相关联的位置处。在循环中重复此操作可模拟父实体的移动。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:108 d109c08f59254cdc9c9c79386fb80368
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved to maintain its relative position with the parent entity."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以保持其相对于父实体的相对位置。"

#: ../../modules/link.md 2a15b393e03a4e5e96f7a0a8f41f5c8b
#: 51996d4ae5d046d0a2c68b8956ab61eb
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

#: ../../modules/link.md:126 12390ce3a333428ca1aa2c4dca7e3e1d
msgid "Replace the entity at its local rotation. This operation repeated in a loop simulates the rotation of the parent entity."
msgstr "将实体放置在其局部旋转处。在循环中重复此操作可模拟父实体的旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:134 c2385ed5f2454d6c8a2fbe4b866f5e2e
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved to maintain its local rotation relative to the parent entity."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以保持其相对于父实体的局部旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md 6f2fda3f612a4476aee9778adf7e572e
#: bf6c24f7482b4475bbddea8e01259197
msgid "Single Axis"
msgstr "单轴"

#: ../../modules/link.md:152 3c41fc8f92c74b27ab4c7cd3973e7e00
msgid "Replace the entity at its relative position along an axis. This operation repeated in a loop simulates the movements of the parent entity on a single axis."
msgstr "将实体放置在相关联的位置的某轴处。在循环中重复此操作可模拟父实体在单个轴上的移动。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:157 ../../modules/link.md:528
#: 10c868a8cfbc4acc9e9a813b6766778e bc37172211624c57ab9d665c6a6212d9
msgid "**Score `@s bs.link.r[x|y|z]`**: Relative position to the parent entity."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.link.r[x|y|z]`**：相对于父实体的位置。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:160 15fd962facff424f881e72fdebe41303
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved to maintain its relative position with the parent entity on a single axis."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以保持其在单个轴上相对于父实体的相对位置。"

#: ../../modules/link.md 19738825699747b9898b45a90d1b883b
#: 98a2bdf2f8704bf5aa0006b5b246f68b
msgid "Single Angle"
msgstr "单旋转角"

#: ../../modules/link.md:182 4c6faa068fa340d798e0e3fa7d21a6b6
msgid "Replace the entity at its horizontal or vertical local rotation. This operation repeated in a loop simulates the rotation of the parent entity on a single rotation axis."
msgstr "将实体放置在其水平或垂直局部旋转处。在循环中重复此操作可模拟父实体在单个旋转轴上的旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:187 ../../modules/link.md:558
#: 103c4f6c012d4e278ba193be58ed2b0c d1652dc037af43439ff1da54b78d58f2
msgid "**Score `@s bs.link.l[h|v]`**: Local rotation relative to the parent entity."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.link.l[h|v]`**：相对于父实体的局部旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:190 bd57e8b907724647a5cd0d6c0b7205b5
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved to maintain its local rotation relative to the parent entity on a single rotation axis."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以保持其在单个旋转轴上相对于父实体的局部旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:208 ../../modules/link.md:579
#: 293dd69fc49746ceb3040ec42c4c45e7 58ab7268770e44f785a9898755ded65d
msgid "While chaining behavior functions is possible, it's not advisable because it involves repeatedly fetching coordinates, performing computations, and applying them. Instead, consider creating [custom behaviors](#custom-behaviors)."
msgstr "虽然链接的行为函数可以叠加使用，但不建议这样做，因为这涉及重复获取坐标、执行计算和应用它们。请考虑创建[自定义行为](#custom-behaviors)。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:215 e87e17c064074e9e8e569dac5abc7c96
msgid "Keep Local Position"
msgstr "保持局部坐标"

#: ../../modules/link.md:219 9d816de9166545d5ad293aa4ebb5cf33
msgid "Keep the local position relative to the parent entity."
msgstr "保持相对于父实体的局部坐标。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:224 8b3f6e1161244d0da59fb4ef8e54bd98
msgid "**Scores `@s bs.link.l[x,y,z]`**: Local position relative to the parent entity."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.link.l[x,y,z]`**：相对于父实体的局部坐标。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:227 ad9385a43d5940c091150b0db47f4a7d
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved to maintain its local position relative to the parent entity."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以保持其相对于父实体的局部坐标。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:230 05c510eb14214287a1094e6a6bb74da8
msgid "*Example: Make armor stands lock to your rotation:*"
msgstr "*示例：让盔甲架锁定到你的旋转：*"

#: ../../modules/link.md ef96c55f6c124dc899742750029ca7a1
msgid "What is a Local Position?"
msgstr "什么是局部位置？"

#: ../../modules/link.md:244 cdfd2aa15b8f495c801adbbd272e64c8
msgid "Unlike relative coordinates, this reference frame considers the entity's rotation. Therefore, when the parent entity rotates, the child entity rotates around it. For those familiar with Minecraft commands, local coordinates are available through the `^` symbol."
msgstr "与相对坐标不同，此参考系考虑实体的旋转。因此，当父实体旋转时，子实体会围绕它旋转。对于熟悉 Minecraft 命令的人来说，可以通过 `^` 符号使用局部坐标。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:251 eb55a4a1b8f34a6498a75e71db36bd62
msgid "Mirror Plane"
msgstr "镜像平面"

#: ../../modules/link.md:255 6a999b0b41c249d8884b5c45d1d9b884
msgid "Mirror the position and rotation of an entity along a plane."
msgstr "沿平面镜像实体的位置和旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:265 7f7f9f4ea26d44758827955b52b64479
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved such as it mirrors the relative position and rotation of the parent entity."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以使其镜像父实体的相对位置和旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:268 6df7ee085e5d4b62a87a0e53c0338881
msgid "*Example: Make armor stands mirror your position and rotation along a plane:*"
msgstr "*示例：让盔甲架沿平面镜像你的位置和旋转：*"

#: ../../modules/link.md:280 ../../modules/link.md:309
#: ../../modules/link.md:406 ../../modules/link.md:431
