msgstr "**贡献者**：Aksiome"

#: ../../modules/link.md:284 3dc5cbe4d1384aa7a36fb97440ea362d
msgid "Mirror Point"
msgstr "镜像点"

#: ../../modules/link.md:288 fb9675852446402fbe6375dfdfb88807
msgid "Mirror the position and rotation of an entity around a given point."
msgstr "围绕给定点镜像实体的位置和旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:293 4b73d479223f46f4a5f4191f6723599e
msgid "**Execution `at <entity>` or `positioned <x> <y> <z>`**: Position of the point around which the entity is mirrored."
msgstr "**执行 `at <实体>` 或 `positioned <x> <y> <z>`**：实体被镜像的点的位置。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:296 ecbe52d2bc9c4b5fb063add632a3d459
msgid "**State**: The entity is moved such as it mirrors the position and rotation of the parent entity around the given point."
msgstr "**状态**：移动实体以使其围绕给定点镜像父实体的位置和旋转。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:299 dec97e865bac49e8b18fcb406fea3b26
