msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "关系"

#: ../../modules/link.md 3b8a2c758bdf4f22aad0919cd7f9e397
msgid "As Children"
msgstr "对子实体"

#: ../../modules/link.md:321 f60fd9e0c81849c3aa69d44e4627db45
msgid "Execute a command as child entities linked to the executing parent entity."
msgstr "以父实体的子实体为执行者执行命令。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:324 ../../modules/link.md:368
#: 378abaab8c3641649777216488245282 c1d39a1b2ade453588643120bfd37aed
msgid "**Execution `as <entities>`**: Execute as parent entities that must have valid child entities."
msgstr "**执行 `as <实体>`**：以父实体为执行者，该实体必须有有效子实体。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:327 ../../modules/link.md:371
#: 936cea91d34d4683a13c606eda48995d a7ef97947257409f8838095fdec16cb2
msgid "**Return**: Fails if the execution entity has no linked child entities."
msgstr "**返回值**：如果执行者没有链接的子实体则失败。"

#: ../../modules/link.md:330 8b7360d962ee472185a843a1140ad451
msgid "*Example: Execute a command as all armor stand children:*"
msgstr "*示例：对所有盔甲架的子实体执行命令：*"

#: ../../modules/link.md 46f0cbd7642e44588ee4d338c75016fc
msgid "As Parent"
msgstr "对父实体"

